[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3A_CRYSTAL]
Crystal Armor (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3A_CRYSTAL_desc]
Hard crystal can withstand most attacks, but remember to pull the curtains, otherwise the enemy can clearly see through the transparent armor your next shell loading progress, your communication with teammates, and even your lunch.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3A_CRYSTAL]
水晶装甲 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3A_CRYSTAL_desc]
坚硬的水晶可以抵挡绝大部分的攻击，但是记得拉窗帘，否则透过透明的装甲敌军可以清清楚楚地看到你下一发炮弹的装填进度，你与队友的交流，甚至你的午餐。
